TEXT 312 576 Left 2 !vb b 0 pwl 0s 10A
TEXT -216 80 Left 2 ;From 0s to 1.5s:\nThe reactive power of the network is about -30MVAr\nThis is the reactive power of the line capacitances\n \nFrom 1.5s to 3.2s:\nThe reactive power goes from -30MVAr to +180MVar\nThis is about 200MVar difference\nThis is due to the inductive reacitve power consume\nof the shorted transformer.
